  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "REV 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "144,000 Sealed",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After this I saw four angels standing at the four corners of the earth, holding back the four winds of the earth to prevent any wind from blowing on the land or on the sea or on any tree.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I saw another angel coming up from the east, having the seal of the living God. He called out in a loud voice to the four angels who had been given power to harm the land and the sea:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Do not harm the land or the sea or the trees until we put a seal on the foreheads of the servants of our God.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I heard the number of those who were sealed: 144,000 from all the tribes of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From the tribe of Judah 12,000 were sealed,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "REV 7:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "from the tribe of Reuben 12,000,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "REV 7:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "from the tribe of Gad 12,000,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "from the tribe of Asher 12,000,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "REV 7:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "from the tribe of Naphtali 12,000,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "REV 7:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "from the tribe of Manasseh 12,000,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "from the tribe of Simeon 12,000,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "REV 7:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "from the tribe of Levi 12,000,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "REV 7:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "from the tribe of Issachar 12,000,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "from the tribe of Zebulun 12,000,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "REV 7:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "from the tribe of Joseph 12,000,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "REV 7:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "from the tribe of Benjamin 12,000.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Great Multitude in White Robes",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After this I looked, and there before me was a great multitude that no one could count, from every nation, tribe, people and language, standing before the throne and before the Lamb. They were wearing white robes and were holding palm branches in their hands.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they cried out in a loud voice:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 7:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Salvation belongs to our God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 7:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "who sits on the throne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 7:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and to the Lamb.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the angels were standing around the throne and around the elders and the four living creatures. They fell down on their faces before the throne and worshiped God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "saying:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 7:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Amen!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 7:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Praise and glory",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 7:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and wisdom and thanks and honor",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 7:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and power and strength",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 7:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "be to our God for ever and ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 7:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amen!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then one of the elders asked me, \"These in white robes—who are they, and where did they come from?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I answered, \"Sir, you know.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "REV 7:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "And he said, \"These are they who have come out of the great tribulation; they have washed their robes and made them white in the blood of the Lamb.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 7:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"they are before the throne of God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 7:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and serve him day and night in his temple;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 7:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and he who sits on the throne",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 7:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "will shelter them with his presence.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'Never again will they hunger;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 7:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "never again will they thirst.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "REV 7:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The sun will not beat down on them,'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "REV 7:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nor any scorching heat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
